[2025.10.16-08.28.48:027][848]Cmd: log
[2025.10.16-08.28.48:066][848]------- Log conventions
[2025.10.16-08.28.48:067][848][cat]   = a category for the command to operate on, or 'global' for all categories.
[2025.10.16-08.28.48:067][848][level] = verbosity level, one of: none, error, warning, display, log, verbose, all, default
[2025.10.16-08.28.48:067][848]At boot time, compiled in default is overridden by ini files setting, which is overridden by command line
[2025.10.16-08.28.48:067][848]------- Log console command usage
[2025.10.16-08.28.48:067][848]Log list            - list all log categories
[2025.10.16-08.28.48:067][848]Log list [string]   - list all log categories containing a substring
[2025.10.16-08.28.48:067][848]Log reset           - reset all log categories to their boot-time default
[2025.10.16-08.28.48:067][848]Log [cat]           - toggle the display of the category [cat]
[2025.10.16-08.28.48:067][848]Log [cat] off       - disable display of the category [cat]
[2025.10.16-08.28.48:067][848]Log [cat] on        - resume display of the category [cat]
[2025.10.16-08.28.48:067][848]Log [cat] only      - enables [cat] and disables all other categories
[2025.10.16-08.28.48:067][848]Log [cat] [level]   - set the verbosity level of the category [cat]
[2025.10.16-08.28.48:067][848]Log [cat] break     - toggle the debug break on display of the category [cat]
[2025.10.16-08.28.48:067][848]------- Log command line
[2025.10.16-08.28.48:067][848]-LogCmds="[arguments],[arguments]..."           - applies a list of console commands at boot time
[2025.10.16-08.28.48:067][848]-LogCmds="foo verbose, bar off"         - turns on the foo category and turns off the bar category
[2025.10.16-08.28.48:067][848]------- Environment variables
[2025.10.16-08.28.48:067][848]Any command line option can be set via the environment variable UE-CmdLineArgs
[2025.10.16-08.28.48:067][848]set UE-CmdLineArgs="-LogCmds=foo verbose breakon, bar off"
[2025.10.16-08.28.48:067][848]------- Config file
[2025.10.16-08.28.48:068][848][Core.Log]
[2025.10.16-08.28.48:068][848]global=[default verbosity for things not listed later]
[2025.10.16-08.28.48:068][848][cat]=[level]
[2025.10.16-08.28.48:068][848]foo=verbose break
